One thing worth flagging: `--tag` filters on the `tags` field, which `store::load_all` populates from the note **body** (the 4th field), not the title. So tags only apply to notes whose body actually contains `#` tokens — consistent with how the rest of the app stores tags, but easy to trip up against if you expect title tags.

